    <string name="ai_metadata_default_prompt">Fill in and correct bibliographic metadata for this EPUB. Use only verifiable information. Generate text fields in the language declared by the EPUB; if the language is missing, infer and fill in its language code. The About field should be short, elegant, and spoiler-free: do not reveal endings, twists, deaths, or hidden identities. Write About with literary quality in the book’s general tone and register; avoid generic promotional language, hype, or awkward phrasing. If there is not enough reliable context to write a good About section, preserve the existing one or leave it null instead of inventing catalog copy. Look for ISBN-10 or ISBN-13 in the ISBN field and EPUB identifiers. Respond with title, subtitle, authors, series, series number, language, publisher, year, tags, ISBN, and About.</string>
